AB  - SORBET is a geometric deep learning framework that directly analyzes complete spatial profiling data. SORBET models tissues as graphs of adjacent cells and applies graph convolutional networks to infer emergent phenotypes such as responses to immunotherapy. Applied to CosMx spatial transcriptomics of pre-treatment metastatic melanoma annotated with response to immunotherapy, and validated on Imaging Mass Cytometry and CODEX datasets from Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer and Colorectal Cancer. SORBET promises to advance personalized medicine through refined patient treatment stratification.
